## Check the implementation

Test several open sections, keyboard navigation, long content and mobile scrolling. Confirm that a user can understand the page before opening every section.

Use the [civica.uk accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html) and compare the rendered result in light and dark modes, Vivid and Muted tones, and at 320 CSS pixels. The example markup is a starting point; a theme alone does not add its application logic.

## Source and related guidance

[NHS expander](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/expander) informs the component choice and interaction guidance. The examples use shared GOV.UK primitives or original civica.uk markup, Arial typography and civica.uk assets. NHS logos and service identity are not used.

